results.description:
"Duello is an online competitive gaming platform where you can challenge friends and other players in fast 1v1 battles.

Duello is not built around just one game. It brings together multiple mini-games based on focus, speed, logic, memory, reaction and strategy. Each game is easy to understand, but winning means being faster, sharper or smarter than your opponent.

Challenge a friend, enter an online duel and find out who comes out on top. Play again, discover new games and improve your performance over time.

With Duello you can:
• battle friends and other players online;
• discover different competitive mini-games;
• join competitions and championships;
• earn points based on competition results;
• climb the season leaderboard;
• track your matches and performance;
• unlock achievements and leagues.

Regular competitions give every battle a bigger purpose. Your final position earns ranking points, while results across multiple championships build your competitive profile.

Duello is about battles, friends and climbing higher. Pick a game, challenge an opponent and let the duel begin."
